{
  "id": "03846_sain",
  "headword": "サイン",
  "reading": "さいん",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, verb (suru)",
  "gloss": "autograph; signature; sign",
  "conjugation": {
    "type": "suru",
    "prefix": "サイン"
  },
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "autograph",
      "explanation": "A celebrity's handwritten signature given to fans."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 2,
      "gloss": "signature",
      "explanation": "A person's name written in their own handwriting."
    },
    {
      "sense_number": 3,
      "gloss": "sign, signal",
      "explanation": "A gesture or indication conveying information or meaning."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex1",
      "japanese": "{有名|ゆうめい}な{歌手|かしゅ}にサインをもらった。",
      "english": "I got an autograph from a famous singer.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex2",
      "japanese": "サイン{会|かい}に{長|なが}い{列|れつ}ができていた。",
      "english": "There was a long line at the autograph session.",
      "notes": "サイン会 = autograph session",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex3",
      "japanese": "{子供|こども}のころに{買|か}ったサイン{入|い}りのボールを{今|いま}でも{大切|たいせつ}にしている。",
      "english": "I still treasure the autographed ball I bought as a child.",
      "notes": "サイン入り = autographed",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex4",
      "japanese": "ここにサインしてください。",
      "english": "Please sign here.",
      "notes": "サインする = to sign",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex5",
      "japanese": "{契約書|けいやくしょ}にサインした。",
      "english": "I signed the contract.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex6",
      "japanese": "{荷物|にもつ}を{受|う}け{取|と}るときに、{配達員|はいたついん}の{端末|たんまつ}にサインを{求|もと}められた。",
      "english": "When I received the package, I was asked to sign on the delivery person's device.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex7",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}がサインを{送|おく}った。",
      "english": "He gave the signal.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex8",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}がサインを{送|おく}ったので、{行動|こうどう}を{開始|かいし}した。",
      "english": "He gave the signal, so we started the operation.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03846_sain_ex9",
      "japanese": "{体|からだ}が{出|だ}しているサインを{見逃|みのが}さないで、{早|はや}めに{病院|びょういん}に{行|い}ったほうがいい。",
      "english": "You should not ignore the signs your body is giving you and go to the hospital early.",
      "notes": "サイン here means warning sign/signal from the body",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        3
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "USAGE: サイン has multiple meanings depending on context. In Japanese, it often refers to autographs from celebrities.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・サインをもらう (to get an autograph)\n・サインする (to sign)\n・サインを{送|おく}る (to give a signal)\n・サイン{会|かい} (autograph session)\n・サイン{入|い}り (autographed)\n\nCONTRAST:\n・サイン (autograph, signature, signal)\n・{署名|しょめい} (formal signature)\n・{合図|あいず} (signal, cue)\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
